Obaef
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 90 ROTATE 3 U 1
QAELE 3 FACE_LAST
QAELE 1 FACE_LAST
QAELE 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
QAELE 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK QAELE QAELE
OR
    AND
        SRC Suit {SPADES, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}
        SRCSTACK Rank equal
    SRCSTACK Rank add_13
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
